<title>SWITZERLAND: ABB details 1996 orders.</title>
<headline>ABB details 1996 orders.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996 vs 1995:</p>
<p>				    (millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Net group orders received  36,349	    vs 36,224</p>
<p>of which</p>
<p> Power Generation	     10,130	    vs 10,515</p>
<p> Power Transmission	   9,885	     vs 8,810</p>
<p> Industry, Building Systems 16,712	    vs 16,029</p>
<p> Adtranz -Transportation     1,912	     vs 3,305</p>
<p> Financial Services	   479		 vs 446</p>
<p> Various, Corporate	   3,415	     vs 3,361</p>
<p> Intra-Group transactions   6,184	     vs 6,242</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is ABB Asea Brown Boveri AG.</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
